-- title:
--   Original full-cell Gaussian combined spatial and discount positive residual vanishes in expected L1
-- statement:
--   The actual original zero-jump Gaussian source physical full stopping cells have an integrable positive part of the combined discounted spatial value increment minus the exact raw first-order and centred second-order source correction. Its expectation vanishes along the physical grid. This formulation preserves cancellation of the generator, avoiding the questionable isolated positive discount error. It is the substantive remaining source-specific combined small/large Gaussian-tail analytic estimate.
-- source:
--   Avram Gaussian top-cap original physical cells; exact generator cancellation a211 and original p4_f11; combined small/large a212/a210 and actual Gaussian energy and exponential tail.

import Mathlib
